# 🏙️ AI-Powered Citizen Complaint Management Platform

An AI-powered civic issue reporting and resolution platform that connects citizens, municipalities, departments, and field workers in a single system.

The platform allows citizens to report problems such as potholes, flooding, garbage, broken streetlights, water leaks, and other civic issues. AI analyzes each report, detects possible duplicates, helps determine priority, and routes the issue to the appropriate municipality and department.

The system also analyzes historical complaints to identify recurring problems, hotspots, and possible long-term solutions.

---

## 🚀 Key Features

### 👤 Citizen Reporting

Citizens can:

- Submit civic complaints
- Upload photos/videos
- Share their location
- Add descriptions
- Track complaint status
- Receive notifications
- Provide feedback after resolution

---

### 🤖 AI-Powered Analysis

AI analyzes submitted complaints to help with:

- Issue classification
- Severity detection
- Confidence scoring
- Department recommendation
- Duplicate detection
- Spam/fraud risk detection
- Priority calculation
- Recurring problem detection
- Root-cause analysis
- AI recommendations

---

### 🔄 Duplicate Report Detection

Multiple citizens may report the same physical problem.

Instead of creating separate cases, the system can identify similar reports using:

- Text similarity
- Image similarity
- Geographic proximity
- Issue category
- Time proximity

Example:

```text
Citizen A → Pothole near school
Citizen B → Large road hole near school
Citizen C → Damaged road outside school

              ↓

        Possible same issue

              ↓

          CASE #1024

Reports: 3
Unique citizens: 3
